  "verified": [
    "The original ODS sheet selection flags and the four upstream XLSX sheet filter/pivot permissions survive ODS reopen.",
    "The imported legacy Excel verifier is double-hashed to the original ODF Excel plus SHA-1 representation in the Worker, and browser primary reopen retains the digest.",
    "A modern-only XLSX digest or mixed incompatible native digest families cannot overwrite the primary document through autosave. The active document retains protection.",
    "Three suspected upstream cases are reproduced and recorded as CALC-734 through CALC-736."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Sheet editing and selection enforcement, protection ranges, password verification and retyping UI, and workbook structure protection require their original owners.",
    "ODS only carries the worksheet permissions present in the source format. XLSX export from ODS-origin verifier bytes follows the original representability boundary.",
    "Existing browser autosave cadence, navigation and recovery policy are unaffected."
  ]
